    "detailed_description": "Story background:<br><br>The departed always leave behind their unfulfilled wishes, while the living always pray for their peace. Even when separated by two worlds, are they willing to cut off this bond?<br>Why not transform into a butterfly and enter the world of death, to see each other's memories of the heart and to see if the bond that you both think cannot be cut off is really as firm as you think in your heart?<br>Realm of Memories, a journey of death game. Are you... ready?<br>   by Alice<br><br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><strong>Maze exploration:</strong><br> In the game, players will enter various well-designed mazes, and must carefully observe, solve puzzles, crack mechanisms, and engage in strategic battles with monsters in order to gradually explore the secrets of the maze and find a way out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/98ef6096911c7ecc9e63cfe657cc3598.poster.avif?t=1726380267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/98ef6096911c7ecc9e63cfe657cc3598.webm?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/98ef6096911c7ecc9e63cfe657cc3598.mp4?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Strategic puzzle solving: </strong><br>In the game, players must make use of the costumes and skills they have collected, combined with the different maze puzzles or monster abilities, in order to solve problems successfully. This requires players to have strategic thinking and problem-solving abilities, challenging themselves and improving their gaming level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/1aed5b51ba50c15924e9ffd63ddafdc5.poster.avif?t=1726380267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/1aed5b51ba50c15924e9ffd63ddafdc5.webm?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/1aed5b51ba50c15924e9ffd63ddafdc5.mp4?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rich collection elements: </strong><br>Players can collect various elements, including cards, memory fragments, costumes, scene scrolls, and tree spirits, each of which will provide certain help to the protagonist in the maze exploration. Collecting all these elements not only helps players to better understand the game world, but also makes their gaming experience richer and more colorful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/217956bdc82ec39e444ebf2eaa4c6f3a.poster.avif?t=1726380267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/217956bdc82ec39e444ebf2eaa4c6f3a.webm?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/217956bdc82ec39e444ebf2eaa4c6f3a.mp4?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Unique narrative approach: </strong><br>The game's story is not only guided by the main storyline, but also includes memory fragments discovered in the maze. These fragments are presented to the player in the form of black and white animations, gradually revealing the story of the game. By collecting memory fragments, players will better understand the game background and characters, making the game more rich and interesting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/400de228af84077428d99d0fa3ae71ee.poster.avif?t=1726380267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/400de228af84077428d99d0fa3ae71ee.webm?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330250/extras/400de228af84077428d99d0fa3ae71ee.mp4?t=1726380267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
